hn's - I wouldn't be working in a jazz room. I would be working in a nice supper club, and John saw that too....", "type": "string"}, "datatype": "string"}, "type": "statement", "id": "Q16320$19BD657D-71A5-4B26-970F-6040EA35A583", "rank": "normal"}]}}